  },
  data: {
    LLM: '1. Deal: 15 cards each (2–5 players) or 13 each (6 players). One card up for discard pile; rest is stock.\n2. Turn: Draw two from stock (or take discard pile under rules, or take one card to add to existing sequence), meld if desired, discard one.\n3. Melds: Groups (3+ same rank, max 2 wilds) and sequences (3–7 same suit, no wilds). Seven-card group = canasta; seven-card sequence = samba.\n4. Going out: Must have two sambas, or two canastas, or one of each; then meld all or all but one and discard the last.\n5. Scoring: Card values plus bonuses (samba 1500, pure canasta 500, mixed 300, going out 200); first to 10,000 wins.',
    Player: '1. Deal: 15 cards each (2–5 players) or 13 each (6 players). One card up for discard pile; rest is stock.\n2. Turn: Draw two from stock (or take discard pile under rules, or take one card to add to existing sequence), meld if desired, discard one.\n3. Melds: Groups (3+ same rank, max 2 wilds) and sequences (3–7 same suit, no wilds). Seven-card group = canasta; seven-card sequence = samba.\n4. Going out: Must have two sambas, or two canastas, or one of each; then meld all or all but one and discard the last.\n5. Scoring: Card values plus bonuses (samba 1500, pure canasta 500, mixed 300, going out 200); first to 10,000 wins.',
    objective: 'Score points by melding groups and sequences; first team to reach 10,000 points at the end of a hand wins.',
    gameplay: '1. Deal: 15 cards each (2–5 players) or 13 each (6 players). One card up for discard pile; rest is stock.\n2. Turn: Draw two from stock (or take discard pile under rules, or take one card to add to existing sequence), meld if desired, discard one.\n3. Melds: Groups (3+ same rank, max 2 wilds) and sequences (3–7 same suit, no wilds). Seven-card group = canasta; seven-card sequence = samba.\n4. Going out: Must have two sambas, or two canastas, or one of each; then meld all or all but one and discard the last.\n5. Scoring: Card values plus bonuses (samba 1500, pure canasta 500, mixed 300, going out 200); first to 10,000 wins.',
    keyRules: [
      'Initial meld must meet minimum point value (50–150) by team score.',
